        "title": "Getsemani pikuan kgou Jisu rui",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Getsemani pikuan khou Jisu rui kalum bam khou,",
            "Meiguai guang kariuna poubaumei ta nimma;",
            "Karu khou 5#^ lat njan thai mak ge,",
            "Amu daimei nun rui thei khang salou e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Rianramei muang jingh (2),",
            "Kalvari ching rukhou poubaumeita suluai;",
            "Sau pirun le siang loupui thing rukhou,",
            "Duplou pui bam thai makge poubaumei rui.",
            "",
            "2. He Simon Pitor le latdiu lung rianra guai thao o,",
            "Poubaumei ta jai the thei nipui bam khou 5#^;",
            "Kandih khou keimei tingkauh Guang daimei,",
            "Riana bam khou nkhalou nimei mak ge.",
            "",
            "3. Kandih le tingkau khou gaipui lat cham loumeiputa,",
            "Suluai nina cho nangniu Zion nah guai le;",
            "Kamei theimei tingmik 5#^ mu nicho?",
            "Aniu ringpui tuange nangniu ring khange.",
            "",
            "4. He seraphim guai le tingkau latdiu nun guai jaolo,",
            "Nkhaloumei maknga rianramei Guang Jisu;",
            "Meinun guai pap phunga rianra bam khou,",
            "Kalung rianrana kapu ta kao bamme.",
            "",
            "5. Jaongam makge pourui Jordan duipang kanpat nimei,",
            "Kajang maknga kapi bumkei lou kan ding the;",
            "Kabumang npatlou kandih khou hei,",
            "Pap le rih ta ngamma Jordan dui kan the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
